// Cormack and the Blades spawn from QHAREA only when Hannibal speaks;
// do not preplace duplicate creatures in the ARE.

// Thug: replace Iron Throne voice lines with Docks Ruffian (DRUFF1) soundset.
// Source creature is unmodified; only sound-set strref 0xA4..0x233 is copied.
COPY_EXISTING ~QRVTHUG.CRE~ ~override/QRVTHUG.CRE~
  INNER_PATCH_FILE ~DRUFF1.CRE~ BEGIN
    READ_LONG 0x0A4 qrvsnd00
    READ_LONG 0x0A8 qrvsnd01
    READ_LONG 0x0AC qrvsnd02
    READ_LONG 0x0B0 qrvsnd03
    READ_LONG 0x0B4 qrvsnd04
    READ_LONG 0x0B8 qrvsnd05
    READ_LONG 0x0BC qrvsnd06
    READ_LONG 0x0C0 qrvsnd07
